@host = http://localhost:5079

### Token da ana - engenharia, clearance 5, admin
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user": "ana" }

### Token do bruno - engenharia, clearance 3, member
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user": "bruno" }

### Token da carla - financeiro, clearance 1, member
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user": "carla" }

### Claims que chegaram no token
GET {{host}}/whoami
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Por perfil - so admin (ana)
GET {{host}}/documents/by-role
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Por policy - clearance >= 3 (ana e bruno)
GET {{host}}/documents/by-policy
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Claim exata - departamento engenharia (ana e bruno)
GET {{host}}/documents/engineering
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Duas exigencias na mesma policy (AND) - so ana
GET {{host}}/documents/senior-engineering
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### RequireAssertion inline - depende do dia da semana
GET {{host}}/documents/weekday
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Por recurso - bruno edita o doc 2 (e dono), mas nao o 1
PUT {{host}}/documents/2
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_BRUNO

### Por recurso - ana edita qualquer um (admin)
PUT {{host}}/documents/3
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_TOKEN_DA_ANA
